fullDescription.text:
Reports calls to 'wait()' made on a 'java.util.concurrent.locks.Condition' object. This is probably a programming error, and some variant of the 'await()' method was intended instead. Example: 'void acquire(Condition released) throws InterruptedException {
    while (acquired) {
      released.wait();
    }
