Inspection ID: UnknownLanguage

fullDescription.text:
Reports conditional expressions with 'then' and else branches that are similar enough so that the expression can be moved inside. This action shortens the code. Example: 'double g(int a, int b) {
    return a == b ? Math.cos(0) : Math.cos(1);
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'double g(int a, int b) {
    return Math.cos(a == b ? 0 : 1);
  }' Inspection ID: ConditionalCanBePushedInsideExpression New in 2017.2

