  }' Example: 'void f(boolean foo, boolean bar) {
    boolean b = (foo && bar) || !foo;
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'void f(boolean foo, boolean bar) {
    boolean b = !foo || bar;
  }' Inspection ID: SimplifiableBooleanExpression

