Reports overloaded methods that take functional interfaces with conflicting abstract method signatures. Such overloads introduce ambiguity and require callers to cast lambdas to a specific type or specify lambda parameter types explicitly. It is preferable to give the overloaded methods different names to eliminate ambiguity. Example: 'interface MyExecutor {
