      private int[] generateNumbers(Random random) {
        return random.ints(1000, 0, 100).toArray();
      }
    }' Use the options to list methods that are safe to be passed to 'ThreadLocalRandom' instances as an argument. It's possible to use regular expressions for method names. Inspection ID: SharedThreadLocalRandom

