fullDescription.text:
Reports non-'Serializable' objects used as arguments to 'java.io.ObjectOutputStream.write()'. Such calls will result in runtime exceptions. This inspection assumes objects of the types 'java.util.Collection' and 'java.util.Map' to be 'Serializable', unless the types they are declared in are non-'Serializable'. Example: 'public class IWantToSerializeThis {
