Reports 'to' function calls that can be replaced with the infix form. Using the infix form makes your code simpler. The quick-fix replaces 'to' with the infix form. Example: 'fun foo(a: Int, b: Int) {
      val pair = a.to(b)
  }' After the quick-fix is applied: 'fun foo(a: Int, b: Int) {
      val pair = a to b
