Reports JUnit annotated methods when used in a test case from a different JUnit version. To determine the framework version for a test case the inspection checks the framework version of the super class when available. When a super class is not available it will use the most used framework in the test case. Example (JUnit 4 annotation in JUnit 3 test case): 'public class MyTest extends TestCase {
